        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "210. After the completion of one full year of service, employees shall begin to earn paid educational leave at the rate of forty (40) hours per year, accumulative to a maximum of 160 hours. Paid educational leave may be taken by full days or by hourly increments as time away from the job, commencing with the thirteenth month of service. Part-time Regular employees will accrue paid educational leave on a prorated basis up to a maximum of one hundred sixty (160) hours.",
